      "heading": "HIC!",
      "mood": "funny",
      "text": "Ada was in bed. Pickle was in his tortoise house. Pickle was a tortoise, and he did everything very, very slowly.\n\nThe moon shone in at the window, round and bright.\n\nThen... HIC!\n\nThe moon jumped.\n\nHIC! It jumped again, right up the sky and back down.\n\nThe moonlight bounced round Ada's room like a ball.\n\nAda sat up. \"Pickle,\" she said. \"The moon has got the hiccups.\"\n\nPickle slowly opened one eye.",
